        <ul class="list-unstyled small mb-0 d-flex flex-column gap-2 text-muted">
          <li>Main Auditoriums & Halls</li>
          <li>Tech & Innovation Labs</li>
          <li>Smart Conference Suites</li>
          <li>Open Amphitheatres</li>
